{"id":"d6024046101f0472","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-resolutions.md","title":"Resolutions","display":"df-resolutions — Resolutions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-resolutions","aliases":["58-df-resolutions"],"display":"df-resolutions — Resolutions","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-projective-resolution.md]]","[[./58-df-injective-resolution.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-resolutions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-resolutions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-resolutions — Resolutions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a1ff59b2909a8ac7\" href=\"?note=a1ff59b2909a8ac7\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-projective-resolution.md\">../batch18/58-df-projective-resolution.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"30a4fc2ff6104eda\" href=\"?note=30a4fc2ff6104eda\" title=\"./58-df-injective-resolution.md\">58-df-injective-resolution.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,R,P_\\bullet,d_P,\\varepsilon,I,d_I,\\eta\\in V\">\\(A,R,P_\\bullet,d_P,\\varepsilon,I,d_I,\\eta\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolution}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolution}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a1ff59b2909a8ac7\" href=\"?note=a1ff59b2909a8ac7\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-projective-resolution.md\">../batch18/58-df-projective-resolution.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InjectiveResolution}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{InjectiveResolution}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"30a4fc2ff6104eda\" href=\"?note=30a4fc2ff6104eda\" title=\"./58-df-injective-resolution.md\">58-df-injective-resolution.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProjRes}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\operatorname{ProjRes}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InjRes}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\operatorname{InjRes}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolutions} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{ProjRes}_S(P_\\bullet,d_P,\\varepsilon,A,R,n) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolution}_S(P_\\bullet,d_P,\\varepsilon,A,R)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\n\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(n&lt;i\\to\\forall x,y\\in P_\\bullet(i)\\;(x=y)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolutions} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{ProjRes}_S(P_\\bullet,d_P,\\varepsilon,A,R,n) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolution}_S(P_\\bullet,d_P,\\varepsilon,A,R)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\n\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(n&lt;i\\to\\forall x,y\\in P_\\bullet(i)\\;(x=y)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolutions\\text{-}injective} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{InjRes}_S(A,I,d_I,\\eta,R,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{InjectiveResolution}_S(I,d_I,\\eta,A,R)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\n\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(n&lt;i\\to\\forall x,y\\in I(i)\\;(x=y)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolutions\\text{-}injective} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{InjRes}_S(A,I,d_I,\\eta,R,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{InjectiveResolution}_S(I,d_I,\\eta,A,R)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\n\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(n&lt;i\\to\\forall x,y\\in I(i)\\;(x=y)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A <strong>projective resolution</strong> computes left derived functors.</li>\n<li>An <strong>injective resolution</strong> computes right derived functors.</li>\n<li>These predicates express length at most <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>; a module carrier above <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> is required to be a singleton rather than being equated with an untyped symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The projective clause now supplies the differential, augmentation, and coefficient ring required by the five-place upstream predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-projective-resolution.md","status":"resolved","id":"a1ff59b2909a8ac7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-projective-resolution.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-injective-resolution.md","status":"resolved","id":"30a4fc2ff6104eda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-injective-resolution.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-projective-resolution.md","status":"resolved","id":"a1ff59b2909a8ac7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolution}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[../batch18/58-df-projective-resolution.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-injective-resolution.md","status":"resolved","id":"30a4fc2ff6104eda","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{InjectiveResolution}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[./58-df-injective-resolution.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,R,P_\\bullet,d_P,\\varepsilon,I,d_I,\\eta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolution}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InjectiveResolution}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProjRes}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{InjRes}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolutions} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{ProjRes}_S(P_\\bullet,d_P,\\varepsilon,A,R,n) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolution}_S(P_\\bullet,d_P,\\varepsilon,A,R)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\n\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(n<i\\to\\forall x,y\\in P_\\bullet(i)\\;(x=y)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolutions\\text{-}injective} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{InjRes}_S(A,I,d_I,\\eta,R,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{InjectiveResolution}_S(I,d_I,\\eta,A,R)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\n\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(n<i\\to\\forall x,y\\in I(i)\\;(x=y)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false}],"bytes":1658,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1084","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-resolutions.md|58-df-resolutions]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["a1ff59b2909a8ac7","30a4fc2ff6104eda"]}